---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import GameGrid from '../components/GameGrid.astro';
import CategoryLinks from '../components/CategoryLinks.astro';
import { games, winterCollection, itemListSchema, breadcrumbSchema } from '../lib/catalog.mjs';
---
<Layout title={'All Winter Games - Play Free Snowboard, Ski & Christmas Games Online'} description="Browse free winter games online. Explore snowboard, ski, and Christmas games, find controls and guides, and choose your next browser adventure." schema={[itemListSchema(games), breadcrumbSchema([{ name: winterCollection.title, path: winterCollection.path }])]}>
  <section class="page-intro"><span class="eyebrow">THE WHOLE MOUNTAIN</span><h1>{winterCollection.title}</h1><p>Every adventure, in one place. Pick your next stop.</p></section>
  <section class="content-section" aria-labelledby="winter-games-collection">
    <div class="section-heading"><div><h2 id="winter-games-collection">Choose your winter game</h2></div></div>
    <GameGrid games={games} />
  </section>
  <section class="content-section prose" aria-labelledby="winter-games-guide">
    <h2 id="winter-games-guide">How to choose your next winter game</h2>
    <p>Explore free winter games across sledding, skiing, snowboarding, and Christmas adventures. Each card opens a guide with controls, instructions, tips, and a play option. Most games load here; Sleigh O’Balance and Waddle Peaks open on their official sites. No app installation or Sled Games account is needed.</p>
    <p>Sled Rider, Downhill Snowboard, and Ski Rush reward surviving downhill runs while collecting presents, coins, or flags. SnowBoard Game and Ski King offer courses with a finish. Snowboard King 2024 adds avalanche chases and ability upgrades; Snowboard Game Party offers mouse or touch obstacle racing; Snowboard Girl uses side-scrolling levels, jumps, and coins. Waddle Peaks starts on skis, with snowboards to unlock for faster spins and higher trick scores.</p>
    <p>Gnome Bobsled adds ice-track time trials: practice the starting push, cornering, and braking, then race your best-record ghost. Sled Line lets you draw roads with a mouse or finger. Sleigh O’Balance uses mouse controls to manage gifts and anvil drops as counterweights on a loaded sleigh. These games bring racing, drawing, and balancing to the sledding collection.</p>
    <p>For a festive change, Merge Christmas combines matching snowballs into bigger characters. Santa Collecting Gifts asks you to catch presents and avoid bombs. Crazy Christmas Fun sends Santa’s sleigh past balloons toward a Christmas tree. Merge Christmas and Crazy Christmas Fun support mouse or touch; Santa Collecting Gifts needs a keyboard.</p>
    <p>Read each guide before starting because objectives and device support vary. We add checked games when available, without a fixed daily or weekly schedule. New entries appear here and in the navigation. Use the category links below to focus on your favorite winter activity.</p>
  </section>
  <CategoryLinks />
</Layout>
